  "editorial": {
    "name": "Baltimore Design System",
    "descriptionZh": "这是巴尔的摩市设计系统的 Storybook 实例，左栏按 GETTING STARTED、FOUNDATIONS、COMPONENTS、PATTERNS、ARCHETYPES、SCREENS 六大段把组件与页面模板归好类。截图时右侧预览区没渲染出来，只有导航结构可看。",
    "takeawayZh": "看 Storybook 左栏分组，抄政府设计系统的分节法",
    "noteZh": "进去是一个 Storybook 壳：左栏顶上写 Baltimore Design System，搜索框提示 Find components ⌃K，下面按 GETTING STARTED / FOUNDATIONS / COMPONENTS / PATTERNS / ARCHETYPES / SCREENS 分组。FOUNDATIONS 里是 Accessibility、Layout Primitives、Breakpoints、Color、Elevation & shadow、Focus、Formatting、Layering、Motion、Radius、Spacing、Status taxonomy、Typography；SCREENS 下面是 AdminLanding、DiagnosticsSummary、LanguageAccessPanel、SignInScreen。截图时右侧主预览区只有一个转圈图标，组件本身没渲染出来，导航里另外能看到 Component Library 与 Data Viz Style Guide 两项。",
